        "−2",
        "0",
        "2",
        "4"
      ],
      "correct": 2,
      "correct_label": "C",
      "explanation": "兩式相加得 4x=16，所以 x=4；由第二式得 y=2，因此 x−y=2。",
      "source": "113、114 年題型改編",
      "image": "q05.png",
      "level": 2
    },
    {
      "id": "q06",
